set"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>That was not the end of the inquiry.</p><p>Apparently, it was another encounter.</p><p>So I am writing this.</p><p>And now you are reading it.</p><p>The editing continues.</p><p><strong>Homo editus, next.</strong></p><p><strong>&#8220;And now you are reading it. The editing continues.&#8221;</strong></p><p><strong>Homo sapiens edits the world.<br>The world edits Homo sapiens.</strong></p><p>We are not merely the species that edits.<br>We are the species that is edited by what we edit.</p><p><strong>Homo editus.</strong></p><p><em>Evolution did not end with Homo sapiens.</em></p><p><strong>Homo editus: The Editing Species, the Edited Species</strong><br><a href="https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B0HHXLQL58?linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=hatenadia0516-22&amp;linkId=ab1020f00e948aee53a1f77d693cbf61&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl">English Edition</a>, 2026</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VmYh!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a5b6cb-1629-4f24-a8e5-6351214c5cf5_1260x952.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VmYh!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a5b6cb-1629-4f24-a8e5-6351214c5cf5_1260x952.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VmYh!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a5b6cb-1629-4f24-a8e5-6351214c5cf5_1260x952.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VmYh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a5b6cb-1629-4f24-a8e5-6351214c5cf5_1260x952.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VmYh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a5b6cb-1629-4f24-a8e5-6351214c5cf5_1260x952.jpeg 1456w" sizes="auto, 100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VmYh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a5b6cb-1629-4f24-a8e5-6351214c5cf5_1260x952.jpeg" width="1260" height="952" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/87a5b6cb-1629-4f24-a8e5-6351214c5cf5_1260x952.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;