60x898.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gs94!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79710c43-d1ed-462f-8dd7-380192eae903_1260x898.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gs94!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79710c43-d1ed-462f-8dd7-380192eae903_1260x898.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gs94!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79710c43-d1ed-462f-8dd7-380192eae903_1260x898.jpeg 1456w" sizes="auto, 100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><em><strong><a href="https://www.amazon.co.jp/Homo-editus-%E7%B7%A8%E9%9B%86%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E7%A8%AE%E3%80%81%E7%B7%A8%E9%9B%86%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B%E7%A8%AE-%E4%B8%80%E7%8B%84-Itekki/dp/B0HHYLLBBR?linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=hatenadia0516-22&amp;linkId=8752d76391c3f76e207089910da7d330&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl">Homo editus: &#32232;&#38598;&#12377;&#12427;&#31278;&#12289;&#32232;&#38598;&#12373;&#12428;&#12427;&#31278;</a></strong></em><strong> by &#19968;&#29380; &#21843; / K.E. Itekki</strong></p><p><strong>More tunnels are already being dug.</strong></p><p>I publish ongoing essays and research notes on <strong><a href="https://note.com/takahashihajime">note</a></strong>, exploring <em>Homo editus</em>, Trace Updating Practice (TUP), AI, life, language, institutions, and whatever I encounter next.</p><p>The original essays are written mainly in Japanese and can also be read through note&#8217;s automatic translation into English and Korean.</p><p>Translation is not a copy.<br>It is another encounter.</p><p><strong>Translation &#8800; Copy.<br>Translation is re-Encounter.</strong></p><p>Read. Trace. Misread. Translate. ZURE.<br>And perhaps, encounter again.</p><p><strong>Trace without Rail.<br>Encounter, next!</strong></p><div><hr></div><p><strong><a href="https://medium.com/@egqe/homo-editus-the-species-that-edits-and-is-edited-a7873254f06a">I&#65372;Species</a></strong><a href="https://medium.com/@egqe/homo-editus-the-species-that-edits-and-is-edited-a7873254f06a"><br></a><em>What is Homo editus?</em></p><p><strong><a href="https://medium.com/@egqe/ai-did-not-invent-homo-editus-it-made-the-editing-visible-2f4fabdeee3a">II&#65372;Relation</a></strong><br><em>What becomes visible when AI enters the encounter?</em></p><p><strong><a href="https://medium.com/@egqe/the-editor-is-one-of-the-outputs-of-editing-737bf7424692">III&#65372;Subject</a></strong><br><em>What happens to the editor through editing?</em></p><div><hr></div><p></p> ]]>
