 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>It was not the destination of the inquiry.</p><p>It is another trace.</p><p>Another temporary form.</p><p>Another encounter surface.</p><p>The book appeared.</p><p>The editing continues.</p><p><strong>Homo editus, next.</strong> &#128099;</p><p><strong>Homo sapiens edits the world.<br>The world edits Homo sapiens.</strong></p><p>We are not merely the species that edits.<br>We are the species that is edited by what we edit.</p><p><strong>Homo editus.</strong></p><blockquote><p><em>Evolution did not end with Homo sapiens.<br>Editing did not begin with AI.<br>What AI exposes is something older:<br>Homo has always been edited.</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Homo editus: The Editing Species, the Edited Species</strong><br><a href="https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B0HHXLQL58?linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=hatenadia0516-22&amp;linkId=ab1020f00e948aee53a1f77d693cbf61&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl">English Edition</a>, 2026</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uDSV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/htt